::  name       layout width ceiling gate
::  shape      width - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 while the width stays at or under 40; answers 0 past the grid
::  law        brushstroke/skate_cell_grid.rye grid_cols=40
::  example    1 -> 1 - 40 -> 1 - 41 -> 0
::  readers    Brushstroke - Skate - Glow layout
::  nib        glow-language journey Orbit 10 -- layout shapes (20261104)
::
::  A rectangle's width cannot exceed the grid's column count. A width
::  of zero is structurally allowed -- a hidden element has no extent.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (gth sample 40)  0  1
